    <http://example.org/node/chunk5> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need The expected solution will have to allow to provide to the agents an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents work environment, capable of accompanying the agents in the agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities could notably bear on: the search for information in the internal procedures and the applicable regulation, the help with the drafting of letters or of answers to the users, the accompaniment in the instruction of files (town planning, social aids, civil status, etc.), the suggestion of actions or of steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk50> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk51> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budgetary constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk53> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk54> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk55> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk56> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk57> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that the client requires a solution that must improve the efficiency of the client administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users, integrate with existing practices of agents, not constitute a rupture in agents modes of work, and comply with regulatory requirements, how can we ensure we proposed solution aligns with these needs while also providing an intelligent assistance tool for municipal agents?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has experience in digital transformation, public sector IT, and smart cities, which are relevant to improving the efficiency of administrative services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., have a proven track record of delivering projects that enhance the quality of service rendered to users, as seen in Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., past references such as the digital workplace transformation for Comune di Torino and the AI-powered document management system for Regione Lombardia." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing practices of agents and avoid constituting a rupture in agents modes of work, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can leverage Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., expertise in change management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., have dedicated change managers who can deliver training through in-person workshops, e-learning, or quick reference guides, ensuring that agents are well-equipped to adapt to the new solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., typical training days per user are 0.5 days, which is a relatively short period, allowing agents to quickly get up to speed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding regulatory compliance, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., maintain a risk register and review risks bi-weekly, considering standard risk categories such as technical, financial, regulatory, operational, and reputational." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., have a low-to-medium risk appetite, ensuring that Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., take necessary precautions to mitigate potential risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., project management certifications, including PMP, PRINCE2 Practitioner, and ITIL v4, demonstrate Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., commitment to delivering projects that meet regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide an intelligent assistance tool for municipal agents, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can draw upon Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., expertise in AI solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., have experience in designing and implementing AI-powered systems that can assist agents in agents administrative activities, such as searching for information, drafting letters or answers to users, and suggesting actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., expertise in digital transformation, change management, regulatory compliance, and AI solutions, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can propose a solution that aligns with the client's needs and provides an intelligent assistance tool for municipal agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., typical delivery structure includes phases such as inception and design, pilot or MVP, full rollout, and operations and support, which ensures that Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., deliver a solution that meets the client's requirements and is well-integrated into the client's existing practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a time of response lower than 2 seconds, high level of availability (99.9%), integration with existing systems of information (business softwares, electronic management of documents, user directories), and API interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current technology stack, how can our design the technical architecture to meet these requirements while ensuring explicability, transparency, and a posteriori understanding of recommendations or proposals?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, our can leverage our expertise in Cloud architecture, API integration, and AI/ML systems. our will design a technical architecture that incorporates our current technology stack." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, to achieve a time of response lower than 2 seconds, our can utilize our experience with inference servers such as vLLM, Ollama, or TGI (Hugging Face) to optimize the performance of our AI/ML models. our can also apply quantisation methods like INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ) to reduce the energetic consumption and improve the response time." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For high availability (99.9%), our can rely on our experience with cloud providers like OVHcloud, Scaleway, or Outscale (SecNumCloud), and utilize containerisation using Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), and Helm to ensure scalability and reliability. our monitoring tools, including Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack, will enable our to track performance and respond promptly to any issues." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing systems of information, our can use our API integration expertise, supporting standards like REST, GraphQL, SOAP (legacy), and CMIS. our will also utilize API gateways such as Kong, Apigee, or AWS API Gateway to securely manage API traffic." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our experience with message brokers like Apache Kafka and RabbitMQ will facilitate communication between different systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explicability, transparency, and a posteriori understanding of recommendations or proposals, our can employ explainability tools like SHAP, LIME, chain-of-thought prompting, and RAG source citation. explainability tools like SHAP, LIME, chain-of-thought prompting, and RAG source citation will provide insights into the decision-making process of our AI/ML models, ensuring that the solution is trustworthy and accountable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, to ensure seamless integration with API interfaces, our will design a modular architecture that allows for easy interaction with various systems, using our expertise in API standards and gateways." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these technologies and expertise, our can create a technical architecture that meets the client's requirements while providing a robust, scalable, and explainable solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands strict GDPR compliance (hosting exclusively on EU territory, no data transfer outside EU, protection of sensitive data through encryption/anonymization), explicability, and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure we solution respects these regulatory requirements, particularly in terms of data protection and sovereignty, while also providing a secure environment for the municipal agents?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., prioritizes GDPR compliance, with a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed to oversee such matters. we can ensure hosting exclusively on EU territory as we standard data residency is set to \"EU only\"." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transferring data outside EU unless there's an explicit legal basis for doing so." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For protection of sensitive data, we utilize anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models. we also implement data subject rights including access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection. we capability to perform Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA) with an average duration of 3 weeks further ensures that we can assess and mitigate risks associated with the processing of personal data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explicability and transparency, we AI security controls include output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, confidence threshold escalation, model isolation (inference API only, no direct model access for end-users), and model update security review. our AI security controls ensure that our solution not only protects sensitive information but also provides transparent and explainable outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide a secure environment for municipal agents, we enforce multi-factor authentication (MFA) with methods including TOTP and hardware tokens (FIDO2), ensuring that only authorized personnel have access to the system. we experience with Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) design and Privileged Access Management (PAM) solutions like CyberArk Conjur and HashiCorp Vault further enhances the security posture of our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, we network security architecture follows zero-trust, micro-segmentation, and defence-in-depth patterns, with Intrusion Detection/Prevention Systems (IDS/IPS) deployed. we also conduct annual penetration testing plus post-major release testing, with the last test showing 2 medium findings that were all remediated, demonstrating we commitment to maintaining a secure environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these capabilities and measures, we can ensure that our solution respects the client's regulatory requirements, particularly in terms of data protection and sovereignty, while providing a secure environment for municipal agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with various regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act) and emphasizes the importance of explicability, transparency, and human oversight." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these requirements given we current legal standing and procurement experience across EU jurisdictions?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the company context, I can identify potential legal risks related to compliance with regulatory frameworks such as GDPR and EU AI Act." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires explicability, transparency, and human oversight, which aligns with we existing policies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Legal Counsel for Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I note that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience with public procurement in various EU jurisdictions, including Italy, France, Germany, Belgium, and EU institutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have also demonstrated expertise in dealing with French Code Commande Publique." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. company context indicates that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. use the standard legal basis of Article 6(1)(e) for performance of tasks in the public interest." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also have a Data Protection Agreement (DPA) template version 3.2 and provide support for Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it is essential to ensure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. subcontractors are also GDPR compliant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

